    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD SERVER</h1><p>[/url]</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>[imgvid poster.avif=\"\" mp4=\"\" webm=\"\" width=\"576\" height=\"324\"][/imgvid]\nYou are a survivor of a great catastrophe. that causes the human race to extinct The world has entered an era of collapse. The weather is full of pollution. Living things died. The only way to survive in this harsh environment is to &quot;adapt&quot;. and evolve to survive in this harsh environment We call this process. &quot;metamorphosis&quot;\n\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"\" mp4=\"\" webm=\"\" width=\"576\" height=\"338\"][/imgvid]\n\n[h2][u][b]cruel world[/b][/u][/h2]\nThe world is full of twisted creatures. How can you yourself survive in this world? What you should do is find food and water to survive. and escape from the dangers of mutant animals.\nOr will you mutate and become like them?\n\n[h2][u][b]Fighting with available weapons[/b][/u][/h2]\nPick up your weapon. You have 2 hands. You can choose to equip the weapon according to your proficiency as you can find it, left hand or right hand, it's up to you. Or punch it with your bare fist. That's yours.\n\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"\" mp4=\"\" webm=\"\" width=\"576\" height=\"324\"][/imgvid]\n\n[h2][u][b]build a shelter[/b][/u][/h2]\nYou need a place to sleep. Create your accommodation But please be careful. You may be invaded. It is recommended to build it strong enough to withstand attacks, at least giving it some safe space to relax</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916950/extras/4d4ea36ff11ab080e7a63ab2dc2ec7cc.poster.avif?t=1715941290\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916950/extras/4d4ea36ff11ab080e7a63ab2dc2ec7cc.webm?t=1715941290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916950/extras/4d4ea36ff11ab080e7a63ab2dc2ec7cc.mp4?t=1715941290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You are a survivor of a great catastrophe. that causes the human race to extinct The world has entered an era of collapse. The weather is full of pollution. Living things died. The only way to survive in this harsh environment is to &quot;adapt&quot;. and evolve to survive in this harsh environment We call this process. &quot;metamorphosis&quot;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916950/extras/82eaea3b783c51aa60ee5f8ac0031241.poster.avif?t=1715941290\" width=576 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916950/extras/82eaea3b783c51aa60ee5f8ac0031241.webm?t=1715941290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916950/extras/82eaea3b783c51aa60ee5f8ac0031241.mp4?t=1715941290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>cruel world</strong></u></h2>The world is full of twisted creatures. How can you yourself survive in this world? What you should do is find food and water to survive. and escape from the dangers of mutant animals.<br>Or will you mutate and become like them?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Fighting with available weapons</strong></u></h2>Pick up your weapon. You have 2 hands. You can choose to equip the weapon according to your proficiency as you can find it, left hand or right hand, it's up to you. Or punch it with your bare fist. That's yours.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916950/extras/32ba438971ae8b0e2aee271d9043a207.poster.avif?t=1715941290\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai